sentences.t:
Sē ðæs lēodhryres lēan gemunde
uferan dōgrum, Ēadgilse wearð
fēasceaftum frēond;

folce gestēpte
ofer sǣ sīde sunu Ōhteres,
wigum ond wǣpnum;

Weard unhīore,
gearo gūðfreca goldmāðmas hēold
eald under eorðan;

Swā bið geōmorlīc gomelum ceorle
tō gebīdanne, þæt his byre rīde
giong on galgan;
